    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17453" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">făbācĕus</span></b>  (also
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">făbācĭus</span></b> ), a,
		um, adj.
		faba, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>consisting of beans</i>, = fabalis
			(post-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">messis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Pall. Nov. 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">puls,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Macr. S. 1, 12 <i>med.</i></span></i>
			—As <i>subst.</i> (sc. puls): <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">făbācĭa</span></b> , ae,
				f., <i><span class="en">Plin. 18, 12, 30, § 118</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Apic. 5,
				6</span></i>.</div>
